WEBVTT

1
00:00:34.666 --> 00:00:37.666
In this final verse of the eighth chapter,

2
00:00:37.666 --> 00:00:40.000
Lord Krishna explains

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.125
that bhakti-yoga is superior

4
00:00:43.125 --> 00:00:46.250
to all forms of spiritual and religious practice.

5
00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:48.750
In the previous verses,

6
00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:50.666
He described various paths of yoga.

7
00:00:50.666 --> 00:00:53.791
Now He concludes the chapter

8
00:00:53.791 --> 00:00:56.375
with this powerful insight.

9
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:02.958
In this verse, Lord Krishna

10
00:01:02.958 --> 00:01:05.500
acknowledges that Vedic study,

11
00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:09.041
yajna, tapasya, and charity –

12
00:01:09.041 --> 00:01:10.500
all of these are valuable

13
00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:13.250
and spiritually purifying acts.

14
00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:14.708
But one who practises

15
00:01:14.708 --> 00:01:17.000
bhakti-yoga receives the benefits

16
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:19.750
of all these acts

17
00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:22.000
effortlessly –

18
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:24.416
and much more besides.

19
00:01:24.416 --> 00:01:27.750
By following the path of devotion,

20
00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:29.708
one not only gains the fruits

21
00:01:29.708 --> 00:01:31.916
of all these virtuous acts,

22
00:01:31.916 --> 00:01:35.791
but also reaches the highest goal –

23
00:01:35.791 --> 00:01:39.166
attaining Lord Krishna's eternal abode.

24
00:01:39.166 --> 00:01:42.333
Lord Krishna emphasises
 that devotion and service

25
00:01:42.333 --> 00:01:44.833
provide a direct path to excellence,

26
00:01:44.833 --> 00:01:46.833
making all other practices

27
00:01:46.833 --> 00:01:50.333
secondary by comparison.

28
00:01:50.333 --> 00:01:52.708
Although tapasya and yajna

29
00:01:52.708 --> 00:01:55.000
are important for spiritual progress,

30
00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:56.416
they are not as powerful

31
00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:58.541
as wholehearted devotion

32
00:01:58.541 --> 00:02:01.791
to Lord Krishna.

33
00:02:01.791 --> 00:02:05.000
The essence of this chapter 
and the previous one

34
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:08.166
establishes the supremacy of bhakti-yoga.

35
00:02:08.166 --> 00:02:11.750
By embracing devotion to Lord Krishna alone,

36
00:02:11.750 --> 00:02:13.625
one can transcend

37
00:02:13.625 --> 00:02:16.916
all other spiritual disciplines and reach directly

38
00:02:16.916 --> 00:02:18.791
to His supreme abode –

39
00:02:18.791 --> 00:02:22.208
Goloka Vrindavan.

40
00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:23.250
Thus,

41
00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:26.250
this verse brings this chain of thought

42
00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:27.750
to a powerful close –

43
00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:30.416
affirming that true devotion

44
00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:32.125
is the highest path of all,

45
00:02:32.125 --> 00:02:35.333
offering far greater rewards
 than any other practice,

46
00:02:35.333 --> 00:02:38.833
and ultimately leading to Lord Krishna

47
00:02:38.833 --> 00:02:41.833
with eternal joy.

48
00:02:46.916 --> 00:02:50.083
Have you ever wondered

49
00:02:50.083 --> 00:02:52.791
what it truly takes

50
00:02:52.791 --> 00:02:57.416
to find success in life?

51
00:02:57.416 --> 00:02:59.208
In life,

52
00:02:59.208 --> 00:03:01.166
you often worry

53
00:03:01.166 --> 00:03:04.916
about doing everything perfectly –

54
00:03:04.916 --> 00:03:07.916
following every rule,

55
00:03:07.916 --> 00:03:10.416
maintaining every ritual,

56
00:03:10.416 --> 00:03:15.125
or meeting everyone’s expectations.

57
00:03:15.125 --> 00:03:17.208
You may think

58
00:03:17.208 --> 00:03:21.416
that doing all the right things

59
00:03:21.416 --> 00:03:24.416
will bring you success, peace,

60
00:03:24.416 --> 00:03:29.500
or even spiritual progress.

61
00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:31.583
But 

62
00:03:31.583 --> 00:03:35.583
I tell you a deeper truth –

63
00:03:35.583 --> 00:03:40.500
it's not about what you do,

64
00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:43.625
but about

65
00:03:43.625 --> 00:03:49.833
where your heart truly rests.

66
00:03:49.833 --> 00:03:52.541
The essence of this verse is this –

67
00:03:52.541 --> 00:03:55.625
all the benefits gained through
 yajna, tapasya, charity,

68
00:03:55.625 --> 00:03:58.208
or any other practice

69
00:03:58.208 --> 00:04:00.083
are received naturally and effortlessly

70
00:04:00.083 --> 00:04:03.291
through devotion and pure surrender

71
00:04:03.291 --> 00:04:09.083
to Me.

72
00:04:09.083 --> 00:04:12.500
When you walk the path of devotion,

73
00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:15.583
the fruits of all other practices
 come to you on their own.

74
00:04:15.583 --> 00:04:20.666
When you see life with genuine
 love and sincerity,

75
00:04:20.666 --> 00:04:27.166
when you focus on what truly matters,

76
00:04:27.166 --> 00:04:30.500
you gain far more

77
00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:33.875
than any mechanical effort can offer.

78
00:04:33.875 --> 00:04:35.458
In your personal life,

79
00:04:35.458 --> 00:04:39.041
instead of worrying about
 completing every duty

80
00:04:39.041 --> 00:04:43.583
or ritual perfectly –

81
00:04:43.583 --> 00:04:46.625
focus on the essence.

82
00:04:46.625 --> 00:04:50.083
Where does your heart truly rest?

83
00:04:50.083 --> 00:04:52.833
Are you living with love, compassion,

84
00:04:52.833 --> 00:04:56.625
and devotion?

85
00:04:56.625 --> 00:04:59.166
When your actions come from a place

86
00:04:59.166 --> 00:05:01.083
of sincerity

87
00:05:01.083 --> 00:05:05.166
and connection with Me,

88
00:05:05.166 --> 00:05:08.166
you receive the full benefit

89
00:05:08.166 --> 00:05:11.166
of everything you do.

90
00:05:11.166 --> 00:05:13.250
Think of

91
00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:14.958
a student

92
00:05:14.958 --> 00:05:18.208
who only worries about memorising facts

93
00:05:18.208 --> 00:05:22.791
and passing exams.

94
00:05:22.791 --> 00:05:24.750
He may pass –

95
00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:28.958
but gains no real knowledge.

96
00:05:28.958 --> 00:05:31.375
On the other hand, a student

97
00:05:31.375 --> 00:05:35.791
who has genuine love and
 dedication for his subject

98
00:05:35.791 --> 00:05:39.208
learns more – and with joy –

99
00:05:39.208 --> 00:05:41.583
without any pressure.

100
00:05:41.583 --> 00:05:43.041
So 

101
00:05:43.041 --> 00:05:47.333
let go of the pressure to do everything.

102
00:05:47.333 --> 00:05:49.333
Focus instead on growing

103
00:05:49.333 --> 00:05:52.791
the love and devotion in your heart.

104
00:05:52.791 --> 00:05:55.416
When you live this way,

105
00:05:55.416 --> 00:06:00.875
you surpass even the greatest achievements

106
00:06:00.875 --> 00:06:03.291
and experience deep peace

107
00:06:03.291 --> 00:06:08.166
and fulfilment.

108
00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:16.750
Family and society –

109
00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:18.458
these are the places

110
00:06:18.458 --> 00:06:20.875
where you express yourself

111
00:06:20.875 --> 00:06:24.708
most fully,

112
00:06:24.708 --> 00:06:29.875
and where your greatest tests also come.

113
00:06:29.875 --> 00:06:31.583
In family life,

114
00:06:31.583 --> 00:06:33.833
it's natural to try to do everything

115
00:06:33.833 --> 00:06:37.333
perfectly –

116
00:06:37.333 --> 00:06:40.250
planning the best holidays,

117
00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:43.125
celebrating every occasion
 with great enthusiasm,

118
00:06:43.125 --> 00:06:47.166
or following every tradition in full detail.

119
00:06:47.166 --> 00:06:53.583
But I want to share a deeper truth with you –

120
00:06:53.583 --> 00:07:00.083
it's not about doing every act perfectly, but

121
00:07:00.083 --> 00:07:03.125
It's about being fully present

122
00:07:03.125 --> 00:07:08.041
with your family in every
 moment and every situation.

123
00:07:08.041 --> 00:07:11.875
Just as devotion and pure surrender

124
00:07:11.875 --> 00:07:15.791
are superior to all other forms of practice,

125
00:07:15.791 --> 00:07:19.541
within your family too –

126
00:07:19.541 --> 00:07:22.333
what truly matters

127
00:07:22.333 --> 00:07:24.541
is not how many activities

128
00:07:24.541 --> 00:07:26.583
or rituals you perform,

129
00:07:26.583 --> 00:07:28.541
but how much love

130
00:07:28.541 --> 00:07:31.875
and attention you bring

131
00:07:31.875 --> 00:07:36.083
to every interaction.

132
00:07:36.083 --> 00:07:38.458
Look,

133
00:07:38.458 --> 00:07:40.583
Just as beautiful flowers

134
00:07:40.583 --> 00:07:43.791
are strung together on a single thread

135
00:07:43.791 --> 00:07:47.333
to make a garland,

136
00:07:47.333 --> 00:07:51.625
the members of a family too

137
00:07:51.625 --> 00:07:56.583
are held together by the invisible
 thread of love and understanding.

138
00:07:56.583 --> 00:07:59.458
It cannot be seen,

139
00:07:59.458 --> 00:08:01.625
but it holds everyone

140
00:08:01.625 --> 00:08:04.625
together beautifully.

141
00:08:04.625 --> 00:08:08.833
When you are truly present
 with your family members, 

142
00:08:08.833 --> 00:08:13.208
when you listen to them with care

143
00:08:13.208 --> 00:08:17.500
and share meaningful time with them,

144
00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:21.291
you build a bond

145
00:08:21.291 --> 00:08:23.791
that is far more precious

146
00:08:23.791 --> 00:08:27.208
than the strictest adherence to routine.

147
00:08:27.208 --> 00:08:29.708
So do not feel the pressure

148
00:08:29.708 --> 00:08:34.708
to do and complete everything.

149
00:08:34.708 --> 00:08:36.375
Instead, focus on

150
00:08:36.375 --> 00:08:39.250
being there for each other,

151
00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:40.666
showing love,

152
00:08:40.666 --> 00:08:44.125
and truly understanding one another.

153
00:08:44.125 --> 00:08:46.916
This quality of connection

154
00:08:46.916 --> 00:08:50.125
is what brings true harmony and joy

155
00:08:50.125 --> 00:08:51.916
to family life –

156
00:08:51.916 --> 00:08:57.500
far more than any perfectly executed task.

157
00:09:02.541 --> 00:09:06.625
When you walk into the workplace

158
00:09:06.625 --> 00:09:10.791
with a long list of tasks,

159
00:09:10.791 --> 00:09:15.000
the pressure of it can unsettle the mind –

160
00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:17.166
can't it?

161
00:09:17.166 --> 00:09:19.625
In your professional life,

162
00:09:19.625 --> 00:09:23.250
you may be eager to take on every project,

163
00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:26.916
attend every meeting, and keep growing

164
00:09:26.916 --> 00:09:29.916
your to-do list –

165
00:09:29.916 --> 00:09:35.958
thinking this will surely bring success.

166
00:09:35.958 --> 00:09:38.125
But

167
00:09:38.125 --> 00:09:42.375
I want to share a divine truth with you –

168
00:09:42.375 --> 00:09:44.666
what matters is not

169
00:09:44.666 --> 00:09:47.666
how much you do,

170
00:09:47.666 --> 00:09:49.833
but how deeply

171
00:09:49.833 --> 00:09:52.708
you engage

172
00:09:52.708 --> 00:09:56.958
with whatever you do.

173
00:09:56.958 --> 00:09:59.500
The essence of this verse is this –

174
00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:02.833
just as devotion, or pure surrender,

175
00:10:02.833 --> 00:10:07.541
is superior to all other spiritual practices,

176
00:10:07.541 --> 00:10:11.583
in the workplace too, quality always matters

177
00:10:11.583 --> 00:10:16.166
more than quantity.

178
00:10:16.166 --> 00:10:18.500
It's not about doing every task,

179
00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:20.458
but about being fully devoted

180
00:10:20.458 --> 00:10:23.958
to the tasks that align

181
00:10:23.958 --> 00:10:28.958
with your goals and values.

182
00:10:28.958 --> 00:10:30.791
Focus,

183
00:10:30.791 --> 00:10:36.083
Just as a skilled artist creates
 something extraordinary

184
00:10:36.083 --> 00:10:39.541
by immersing himself completely in his craft,

185
00:10:39.541 --> 00:10:43.166
a dedicated karma-yogi

186
00:10:43.166 --> 00:10:46.708
achieves exceptional results

187
00:10:46.708 --> 00:10:50.000
by giving full sincerity to his work.

188
00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:52.750
Think of a salesperson who

189
00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:56.666
tries to meet every possible customer,

190
00:10:56.666 --> 00:10:59.250
running around all day,

191
00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:02.250
contacting dozens of people –

192
00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:04.333
but only managing

193
00:11:04.333 --> 00:11:07.166
surface-level conversations with all.

194
00:11:07.166 --> 00:11:10.125
And then think of another salesperson

195
00:11:10.125 --> 00:11:13.250
who meets just five customers,

196
00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:18.125
but understands each one’s needs deeply,

197
00:11:18.125 --> 00:11:21.083
listens to their questions patiently,

198
00:11:21.083 --> 00:11:23.541
and finds solutions to their problems

199
00:11:23.541 --> 00:11:25.583
with full sincerity.

200
00:11:25.583 --> 00:11:28.833
That second person is far more successful –

201
00:11:28.833 --> 00:11:31.125
and fulfilled.

202
00:11:31.125 --> 00:11:33.750
When you bring genuine effort,

203
00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:36.791
attention, and dedication to your work,

204
00:11:36.791 --> 00:11:39.000
when you see your work not as a task

205
00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:42.000
but as an act of service –

206
00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:45.166
you achieve results

207
00:11:45.166 --> 00:11:51.583
far superior to scattered effort.

208
00:11:51.583 --> 00:11:53.375
So instead of

209
00:11:53.375 --> 00:11:58.958
overwhelming yourself with too many things,

210
00:11:58.958 --> 00:12:00.958
focus wholeheartedly

211
00:12:00.958 --> 00:12:04.250
on fewer things.

212
00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:09.625
This approach not only elevates your work

213
00:12:09.625 --> 00:12:10.916
but brings

214
00:12:10.916 --> 00:12:14.750
a sense of purposeful fulfilment –

215
00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:20.416
something that mere busyness can never give.
